Subject: [PATCH 3/7] Refresh preview surface for Cinematic mode

Cinematic mode replaces the GPU preview surface after its camera-open
Single has already completed. Include mode 0xe3 in the existing
updatePreviewSurface path so its capture session is created against the
replacement surface.
---
 smali/com/android/camera/Camera.smali | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/smali/com/android/camera/Camera.smali b/smali/com/android/camera/Camera.smali
index 77f0f85d..a26eef36 100644
--- a/smali/com/android/camera/Camera.smali
+++ b/smali/com/android/camera/Camera.smali
@@ -8976,6 +8976,10 @@
 
     const/16 v0, 0xe1
 
+    if-eq p1, v0, :cond_6
+
+    const/16 v0, 0xe3
+
     if-eq p1, v0, :cond_6
 
     const/16 v0, 0xe4
